# Pedejá — environment configuration (copy to .env to activate)
#
# The app runs fully on local mocks without these variables.
# Set them only when connecting a real Supabase project.
# NEVER expose a service-role key here.
#
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key